Bundled reference content
-------------------------

The reference material under `skills/wcag-22-aa/references/` is distilled from public
documentation. It is not original Albitor content and paraphrases the upstream sources:

* Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2
  https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/
  (c) W3C. Used under the W3C Document Licence:
  https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license/

* W3C WAI, Evaluating Web Accessibility
  https://www.w3.org/WAI/test-evaluate/
  (c) W3C. Used under the W3C Document Licence.

The reference files are a distilled snapshot for convenience and may lag the live sources. Always
confirm exact, current detail against the original URLs.

Dependencies
------------

The harness installs, from npm, `@playwright/test` (Apache-2.0, Microsoft Corporation) and
`@axe-core/playwright` with `axe-core` (MPL-2.0, Deque Systems). Neither is bundled here.
